@startuml State Diagram - Registration States

[*] --> Pending : User registers for event

Pending --> Approved : Organizer approves
Pending --> Rejected : Organizer rejects
Pending --> Cancelled : User cancels

Approved --> Attended : Event date passed
Approved --> NoShow : Event date passed\nwithout check-in

Rejected --> [*] : Final state
Cancelled --> [*] : Final state
Attended --> [*] : Final state
NoShow --> [*] : Final state

note right of Pending
    Initial state after
    registration creation
end note

note right of Approved
    User can participate
    in the event
end note

note right of Rejected
    Registration denied
    by organizer
end note

note right of Attended
    User participated
    successfully
end note

note right of NoShow
    User registered but
    didn't attend
end note

@enduml